1233
01:12:05,612 --> 01:12:07,512
And now...

1234
01:12:07,512 --> 01:12:10,812
...a Hand In Cushion for Gramps!

1235
01:12:10,812 --> 01:12:14,112
Woo! Do you remember seeing it?

1236
01:12:14,112 --> 01:12:19,512
Sadly, there is no Ojisan to show you how soft and fluffy it is...

1237
01:12:19,512 --> 01:12:22,612
...but it is very fluffy, and it's made from a very squishy material!

1238
01:12:22,612 --> 01:12:26,612
You'll never want to stop squeezing it!

1239
01:12:26,612 --> 01:12:29,912
I'm going to squeeze it! Squeeze it, squeeze it!

1240
01:12:29,912 --> 01:12:32,312
And it's a Gramps!

1241
01:12:32,312 --> 01:12:34,612
Gigi!

1242
01:12:34,612 --> 01:12:38,112
Whoa!

1243
01:12:38,112 --> 01:12:40,512
CC! Check this out!

1244
01:12:40,512 --> 01:12:43,112
It's an Otomo Pouch & Socks set!

1245
01:12:43,112 --> 01:12:47,912
And if you want the socks, Monday, Tuesday, every day of the week, seven pairs of socks!

1246
01:12:47,912 --> 01:12:51,912
And then you have your little pouch, the little Otomo pouch to put it in, to store your...

1247
01:12:51,912 --> 01:12:53,412
...socks!

1248
01:12:53,412 --> 01:12:58,112
Yeah, it's really cute. You can put anything in it, of course, not only socks, but yeah.

1249
01:12:58,112 --> 01:13:02,112
I really like it. It's a little Otomo, and it reminds me of the Otomo pouch I made once.

1250
01:13:02,112 --> 01:13:05,112
I like it a lot! Please get it!

1251
01:13:05,112 --> 01:13:08,612
Okay, Raora! You could put your toes in your Otomo socks!

1252
01:13:08,612 --> 01:13:10,512
It's my turn!

1253
01:13:10,512 --> 01:13:15,112
And this is Raora's Pencil Case & Keychain set!

1254
01:13:15,112 --> 01:13:18,612
It's me wearing a Chatino costume, and...

1255
01:13:18,612 --> 01:13:22,612
...I'll be so happy if you fill it... It's so cute!

1256
01:13:22,612 --> 01:13:25,112
You like it? Yeah!

1257
01:13:25,112 --> 01:13:27,612
I'll be so happy if you fill it with...

1258
01:13:27,612 --> 01:13:33,512
...lots of stationery and use it at school or in the office or really anywhere you want!

1259
01:13:33,512 --> 01:13:37,112
And the keychain can be attached to the pencil case...

1260
01:13:37,112 --> 01:13:40,512
...so you clip it onto your bag or anything you like!

1261
01:13:40,512 --> 01:13:44,912
Super cute!

1262
01:13:44,912 --> 01:13:47,512
With soft sleeping Chatino.

1263
01:13:47,512 --> 01:13:50,112
Everything's really cute! I'm super excited to see you guys get them!

1264
01:13:50,112 --> 01:13:53,712
I'm very excited to see all of Justice's merch, and...

1265
01:13:53,712 --> 01:13:56,612
...if you want to know when can we purchase them...

1266
01:13:56,612 --> 01:14:00,712
...well, they will all be available to purchase right after this stream!

1267
01:14:00,712 --> 01:14:04,312
So make sure to check them out ASAP!

1268
01:14:04,312 --> 01:14:06,612
And that's our merch announcement!

1269
01:14:06,612 --> 01:14:09,612
That's... oh, the first one!

1270
01:14:09,612 --> 01:14:12,412
And as CC just mentioned, there is one more announcement!

1271
01:14:12,412 --> 01:14:15,812
And you all know, Justice will be performing live for...

1272
01:14:15,812 --> 01:14:19,512
...the very first time...

1273
01:14:19,512 --> 01:14:23,112
...at the hololive English 3rd Concert!

1274
01:14:23,112 --> 01:14:27,212
Woo!

1275
01:14:27,212 --> 01:14:34,612
Taking place at Radio City Music Hall in New York on August 23rd and 24th PDT!

1276
01:14:34,612 --> 01:14:38,312
And right after this stream...

1277
01:14:38,312 --> 01:14:41,612
...we will be redirecting you into the...

1278
01:14:41,612 --> 01:14:44,312
...music video of "ALL FOR ONE"!

1279
01:14:44,312 --> 01:14:48,612
Justice is also in there, of course, and maybe you'll see...

1280
01:14:48,612 --> 01:14:52,612
...maybe you'll see us doing some stuff! Who knows?

1281
01:14:52,612 --> 01:14:56,112
We'll be moving and grooving! Grooving baby!

1282
01:14:56,112 --> 01:14:59,112
So make sure to stay tuned! It's going to be very, very soon!

1283
01:15:00,120 --> 01:15:01,920
It's getting a little sad...

1284
01:15:01,920 --> 01:15:04,320
but it's almost time to say goodbye.

1285
01:15:04,920 --> 01:15:06,220
Before we go,

1286
01:15:06,220 --> 01:15:09,620
let's each share our thoughts and thank all our fans for their support.

1287
01:15:10,620 --> 01:15:12,120
Gigi, you go first.

1288
01:15:12,220 --> 01:15:13,620
Me? Me? Okay.

1289
01:15:14,320 --> 01:15:15,720
Grems! Thank you so much

1290
01:15:15,720 --> 01:15:18,220
for supporting us all this time!

1291
01:15:18,220 --> 01:15:20,620
And can you believe it's been a little over a year now?

1292
01:15:20,620 --> 01:15:22,320
And so many more years

1293
01:15:22,320 --> 01:15:25,120
with JustChats, Justice, and Grems!

1294
01:15:30,120 --> 01:15:32,520
Gosh... Hello...

1295
01:15:32,520 --> 01:15:35,020
Thank you so much!

1296
01:15:35,120 --> 01:15:38,320
Gosh, Rosarians, give me a mighty huzzah!

1297
01:15:38,320 --> 01:15:39,920
We did it!

1298
01:15:39,920 --> 01:15:44,320
Oh my gosh, thank you so much for joining all of us on our adventure here at Hololive!

1299
01:15:44,320 --> 01:15:47,920
I can't... I can't believe it! Oh my gosh, we're 3D now!

1300
01:15:48,420 --> 01:15:50,120
And we're going to be in a concert!

1301
01:15:50,120 --> 01:15:53,720
And... everything's happening!

1302
01:15:53,720 --> 01:15:57,120
Like, all our dreams are coming true, and it's all thanks to you guys! Thank you so, so much!

1303
01:15:57,120 --> 01:15:58,420
Onwards!

1304
01:15:58,420 --> 01:15:59,420
And upwards!

1305
01:15:59,420 --> 01:16:01,420
Huzzah!

1306
01:16:02,120 --> 01:16:03,320
Thank you very much!

1307
01:16:03,320 --> 01:16:05,220
Thank you so much, everyone!

1308
01:16:05,220 --> 01:16:07,220
Thank you, JustChats, thank you, Otos, thank you, everyone!

1309
01:16:07,220 --> 01:16:08,620
Thank you, Justice, of course!

1310
01:16:08,620 --> 01:16:10,020
It's been a lot of fun.

1311
01:16:10,020 --> 01:16:13,620
We worked very hard, and I'm so excited and happy that you all got to see it finally!

1312
01:16:13,620 --> 01:16:16,920
And we're also really excited to be in the 3D concert, so, yeah!

1313
01:16:16,920 --> 01:16:19,120
Thank you from the bottom of our hearts

1314
01:16:19,120 --> 01:16:21,420
for supporting us thus far!

1315
01:16:21,420 --> 01:16:23,120
Please keep supporting us from now on!

1316
01:16:25,220 --> 01:16:26,620
Yes, yes, yes, yes!

1317
01:16:26,620 --> 01:16:30,120
Tutti, tutti, tutti, tutti, tutti, tutti!

1318
01:16:30,120 --> 01:16:32,420
Thank you so much for supporting Justice

1319
01:16:32,420 --> 01:16:35,920
for a whole year and many more to come!

1320
01:16:38,320 --> 01:16:40,920
This has been a dream come true for me,

1321
01:16:40,920 --> 01:16:43,820
being in 3D, dancing with you guys, and having fun!

1322
01:16:43,820 --> 01:16:45,420
So I really, really appreciate it.

1323
01:16:45,420 --> 01:16:48,420
Thank you so much from the bottom of my heart!

1324
01:16:48,420 --> 01:16:49,920
Big kiss!

1325
01:16:49,920 --> 01:16:55,320
We are Justice!

1326
01:16:56,320 --> 01:16:59,920
Once again, thank you all for watching our very first 3D collab stream today!

1327
01:17:00,120 --> 01:17:03,120
Please keep supporting Justice!

1328
01:17:03,120 --> 01:17:05,220
Justice!

1329
01:17:05,220 --> 01:17:06,620
Just like that!

1330
01:17:06,620 --> 01:17:08,620
Justice!

1331
01:17:08,620 --> 01:17:10,120
Get get get that!

1332
01:17:11,320 --> 01:17:14,320
Bye-bye, everyone!

1333
01:17:14,320 --> 01:17:22,120
Bye-bye! Bye-bye!

1334
01:17:22,120 --> 01:17:26,620
Make sure to eat, drink, hydrate, and all that jazz! All right, bye-bye!

